.env.test
reports/*.html
reports/*.json
reports/screenshots/
reports/playwright-html/
!reports/.gitkeep
# The template is source, not an artefact — keep it in-tree.
!reports/template.html

# …and the half-written ones. `reports/*.json` did not cover `*.json.tmp`, so a
# report the monitoring cron was mid-write on got swept into a commit by an
# unrelated `git add -A` on 2026-07-31. Nothing sensitive was in it — HTTP
# statuses, container counts, disk and memory — but a scratch file has no
# business in the tree, and the next one might not be so dull.
reports/*.tmp
